#chip 16F1829, 1

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Clock speed: 1 MHz PIC clock (a quarter cycle per microsecond)
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 250 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Repeat For 1 ms
    nop
End Repeat
Do
Loop
